@page "/privacy-notice"
@using MudBlazor

<div style="background-color: #f8fafc; min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 64px; font-family: 'Figtree', sans-serif;">
    <!-- Simple Header with Logo -->
    <div style="background-color: #122656; padding: 24px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 4px solid #1E9FE0;">
        <a href="/">
            <img src="image/logo_with_words.png" alt="People Core" style="height: 48px; filter: brightness(0) invert(1);" />
        </a>
    </div>

    <MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Medium" Class="mt-12 pa-8 pa-md-16" Style="background-color: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h3" Style="font-family: 'Figtree', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; color: #111;" Class="mb-4 text-center">Privacy Notice</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-12 text-center" Style="color: #64748b;">Effective Date: June 9, 2025</MudText>

        <div class="privacy-content">
            <p>At PeopleCore HRIS, we are committed to protecting your personal information and respecting your privacy. This Privacy Notice provides a concise overview of how we collect, use, share, and protect your data when you use our Human Resource Information System (HRIS).</p>
            <p>For full details, please refer to our comprehensive <a href="/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

            <h3>What Data We Collect and Why</h3>
            <p>We collect information necessary to provide seamless HR management, process payroll, and ensure legal compliance.</p>
            
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Data Category</th>
                        <th>What It Includes</th>
                        <th>Why We Collect It</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Identification & Contact</strong></td>
                        <td>Name, date of birth, civil status, government IDs (SSS, TIN, PhilHealth), email, address, phone.</td>
                        <td>To identify you, establish your employee profile, and communicate with you.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Employment Details</strong></td>
                        <td>Job title, department, employment status, work history, performance metrics.</td>
                        <td>To manage organizational workflows, evaluations, and role-based access.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Payroll & Compensation</strong></td>
                        <td>Salary details, bank accounts, tax declarations, benefits, and deductions.</td>
                        <td>To accurately process wages, manage benefits, and ensure tax compliance.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Attendance & Leave</strong></td>
                        <td>Time logs, leave applications, overtime records.</td>
                        <td>To track work hours, manage schedules, and process correct payouts.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>System Usage & Cookies</strong></td>
                        <td>Login timestamps, IP addresses, device info, and cookie data (Essential, Preference, Analytics).</td>
                        <td>To secure your account, optimize system performance, and improve user experience.</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <h3>Who We Share Your Data With</h3>
            <p>We only share your data when necessary to operate our services or comply with the law. We do not sell your personal data. We may share your information with:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Your Employer (The Client):</strong> Authorized personnel managing HR and payroll within your organization.</li>
                <li><strong>Government Agencies:</strong> Entities like the BIR, SSS, and PhilHealth, as required by law.</li>
                <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Trusted third parties assisting with cloud hosting, analytics, and payroll integration under strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
                <li><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong> Law enforcement or courts, if required to comply with lawful requests or to protect company rights and safety.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Data Security and Retention</h3>
            <h4>How We Protect It:</h4>
            <p>We safeguard your data using industry-standard measures, including data encryption (in transit and at rest), role-based access controls, regular security audits, and secure hosting environments. In the highly unlikely event of a data breach, we will notify affected individuals and the National Privacy Commission (NPC) within 72 hours.</p>

            <h4>How Long We Keep It:</h4>
            <p>We retain your data only as long as necessary or as legally required. For example:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Employee Records:</strong> Up to 5 years post-employment.</li>
                <li><strong>Payroll & Tax Data:</strong> Up to 10 years to comply with BIR requirements.</li>
                <li><em>Upon subscription termination, data is securely deleted or returned to your employer.</em></li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Your Rights as a Data Subject</h3>
            <p>Under the Data Privacy Act of 2012, you have the right to control your personal information. You have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you.</li>
                <li><strong>Request correction</strong> of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
                <li><strong>Request deletion</strong> of your data, subject to legal and contractual constraints.</li>
                <li><strong>Object to or restrict</strong> the processing of your data.</li>
                <li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> for optional processing (like marketing or surveys) at any time.</li>
                <li><strong>Lodge a complaint</strong> with the National Privacy Commission (NPC).</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Contact Us</h3>
            <p>To exercise your rights or if you have any questions regarding how your data is handled, please reach out to your HR department or contact our Data Protection Officer directly:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:dataprivacy@peoplecore.net">dataprivacy@peoplecore.net</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </MudContainer>
</div>

<style>
    .privacy-content h3 {
        font-family: 'Figtree', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: #111;
    }
    
    .privacy-content h4 {
        font-family: 'Figtree', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        color: #333;
    }

    .privacy-content p {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #444;
    }

    .privacy-content ul {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .privacy-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #444;
    }

    .privacy-content table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .privacy-content th, .privacy-content td {
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        text-align: left;
    }

    .privacy-content th {
        background-color: #f1f5f9;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #111;
    }
    
    .privacy-content a {
        color: #1E9FE0;
        text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .privacy-content a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
